entityDescription:
Galgo Management Systems offers consultancy services to public and private organisations with a view to:
1) simplifying the complexity of their Management System;
2) obtaining Quality certifications such as the ISO 9001:2026 standard;
3) facilitating changes within the organisation.
These services involve reviewing and optimising all working methods, processes, procedures, guidelines and support tools by eliminating duplications, gaps, inaccuracies and ambiguities, in order to make the Management System as streamlined and efficient as possible.
We also support change management using facilitation tools such as conflict management, coaching and mediation in multicultural environments.
